# Only track .meta/ (template + registry) and top-level docs. Everything
# else (live per-run dirs and the .archive/ of retired runs) is large and
# reproducible, so it is not committed. .archive/ is also gitignored by
# virtue of starting with a dot -- it stays local-only or on EAI.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.meta/
!.meta/**
# Re-ignore large machine-local raw run trees under .meta/
.meta/runs_splitter_v2/
